                        <div class="g-flow"><span>2026</span><b class="g-step rent" style="--n: 5">TikTok</b><b class="g-step rent" style="--n: 6">Sephora</b><b class="g-step own" style="--n: 7">The product</b><b class="g-step rent" style="--n: 8">TikTok</b></div>
                        <p class="g-lede" style="margin-top:0.6cqw">In 2018 the team warned Sephora would take 40 to 50% of the margin. Now discovery, the sale and the conversation all happen on someone else’s platform.</p>
