                        <p class="g-lede">The hook: ask your group chat what you smell like. Their words get printed on your bottle, and every post links back to Glossier. Sephora sells the first bottle. Glossier owns every bottle after it.</p>
                        <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:0.8cqw"><span class="g-tag">#WhatDoISmellLike</span><span class="g-tag">Target: 25% of new customers from a friend</span></div>
                    </div>
