                <p class="g-kick">How to measure it</p>
                <h4 class="g-title" style="font-size:clamp(22px, 4.6cqw, 54px);max-width:40cqw">Glossier doesn’t need to be cool again. <em>It needs its friends back.</em></h4>
                <p class="g-lede" style="max-width:36cqw;color:#2A1810 !important"><b>The one number:</b> community-sourced revenue, the share of sales that start in Glossier’s own channels (the Club, creators, the flagships). Today Sephora owns that start. The target: 35% by the end of 2027.</p>
                <p class="g-lede" style="max-width:36cqw;color:#2A1810 !important"><b>What to stop:</b> chasing TikTok trends against Rhode, opening more stores, and treating Sephora as home.</p>
